{"generated_at":"2026-07-30T03:26:01.934508Z","scope":"week","paper_count":31,"topics":[{"name":"Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","count":11},{"name":"Dust and ISM","count":9},{"name":"Other Selected Research","count":7},{"name":"Galaxy Evolution","count":6},{"name":"Strong Gravitational Lensing","count":4}],"papers":[{"id":"2607.22787","canonical_id":"2607.22787","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Probing Dark Matter Substructure with Wave-Optics Distortions of Strongly Lensed LISA Gravitational Waves","authors":["Tonghua Liu","Kai Liao","Marek Biesiada","Jieci Wang"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO","gr-qc"],"summary":"本文研究了强引力透镜效应对引力波信号相位的影响，探讨如何利用重复的透镜信号区分三种暗物质结构（NFW、SIDM和FDM），发现NFW与FDM、SIDM与FDM在约60和110个分辨图像波形后可区分。","date":"2026-07-28","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.22787","score":100,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2607.19478","canonical_id":"2607.19478","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"A pilot sample of Planck-selected strongly lensed sub-mm galaxies: NOEMA observations and physical characterisation","authors":["Leonardo Trobbiani","Matteo Bonato","Ivano Baronchelli","Gianfranco De Zotti","Mattia Negrello","Marika Giulietti","Cristian Vignali","Marcella Massardi"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文利用NOEMA望远镜对Planck探测到的四个强引力透镜高红移星系候选体进行了成像和光谱分析，通过连续谱和CO谱线观测确认了其强透镜性质，测定了精确红移（z~2.3-3.3），并揭示了其分子气体分布与运动学特征。","date":"2026-07-23","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.19478","score":100,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28},{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","Multi-phase and Molecular Gas"]},{"id":"2607.19472","canonical_id":"2607.19472","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Cosmic CORALS: Timing the Universe with high-z star clusters","authors":["Elena Tomasetti","Martin Millon","Licia Verde","Frédéric Courbin","Raul Jimenez","Michele Moresco","Carmela Lardo","Andrea Cimatti"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文利用JWST在高红移（z=9.625）透镜星系中发现的古老星团，通过宇宙学无关的SED拟合得到星族年龄，再结合本地球状星团年龄，对平坦ΛCDM模型进行贝叶斯拟合，测得H₀=70⁺²⁷₋₁₆ km/s/Mpc和Ωₘ=0.33⁺⁰.³⁷₋₀.₂₁。研究表明，未来约300个透镜原球状星团样本可将H₀精度提升至4%，Ωₘ精度提升至11%，提供了一种独立于现有方法的宇宙学新途径。","date":"2026-07-23","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.19472","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2607.22812","canonical_id":"2607.22812","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Speeding up Gravitational Lens Mass Models with Machine Learning: Applications in X-ray Astronomy","authors":["Alex Ostridge","Rafael Martínez-Galarza","Júlia M. Sisk-Reynés","Daniel A. Schwartz","Anna Barnacka"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.HE"],"summary":"本文提出一种基于模拟的机器学习方法，利用神经网络快速预测四重透镜类星体的质量参数和椭率，将质量建模时间从数天缩短至几分钟，并将该方法应用于七个已知系统，为X射线-光学发射区定位提供支持。","date":"2026-07-28","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.22812","score":88,"stars":5,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]},{"id":"2607.22966","canonical_id":"2607.22966","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"A quasar hatching from a buried red phase at z = 3.7","authors":["Zheng Ma","Yongda Zhu","Zhiyuan Ji","Eiichi Egami","Marcia J. Rieke","Xiaohui Fan","Jianwei Lyu","George H. Rieke","Fengwu Sun","Yang Sun","George D. Becker","Andrew J. Bunker","Francesco D'Eugenio","Xiangyu Jin","Ignas Juodžbalis","Weizhe Liu","Roberto Maiolino","Pierluigi Rinaldi","Feige Wang","Christopher N. A. Willmer","Yunjing Wu","Jinyi Yang","Junyu Zhang","Peixin Zhu"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文报道了一个名为\"Hatchling\"的红类星体（JADES-GS 209777，z=3.711），通过多波段数据（JWST、HST、ALMA等）分析，发现其活跃核仍部分被致密气体和尘埃包裹，但正在经历反馈过程，逐渐从遮蔽状态向更透明的活跃核阶段过渡。","date":"2026-07-28","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.22966","score":82,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"multi-phase gas","points":16},{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2607.24952","canonical_id":"2607.24952","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Reaching the Metallicity Floor at $z\\sim 10$: Lensed Star Clusters at Cosmic Dawn and Cosmic Noon","authors":["Raul Jimenez","Elena Tomasetti","Carmela Lardo","Licia Verde"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文通过分析宇宙黎明期（z=9.625）的Cosmic Gems弧和宇宙正午（z=1.378）的Sparkler星系中的星团种群，发现早期星团形成于极低金属丰度环境（[Z/H]≈-2.3），与银河系球状星团的金属丰度下限一致；而较晚形成的星团金属丰度更高（[Z/H]≈-0.5）。两个系统共同揭示了从宇宙黎明到宇宙正午期间星团形成环境的演化。","date":"2026-07-29","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24952","score":77,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"stellar physics","points":-32}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2607.19491","canonical_id":"2607.19491","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Rapid growth in a dual AGN during a gas-rich merger at z~4.5","authors":["Hyewon Suh","Roberto Decarli","Emanuele Paolo Farina","Julia Scharwächter","Mar Mezcua","Giorgio Lanzuisi","Federica Loiacono","Brian C. Lemaux","Sukyoung K. Yi","Stefano Marchesi","Marta Volonteri","Günther Hasinger","Francesca Civano","Anniek Gloudemans","Ena Choi","Yeonwoo Nam","Adi Foord","Silvia Onorato"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"在红移z~4.5处发现了一对距离仅1.5 kpc的双活动星系核（LID-1166），这是首个超出局域宇宙的近距离双AGN系统，通过JWST和ALMA证实了两个正在活跃吸积的超大质量黑洞，揭示了早期宇宙中隐藏的并合驱动双AGN群体。","date":"2026-07-23","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.19491","score":73,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas"]},{"id":"2607.21464","canonical_id":"2607.21464","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"ALMA CO-CAVITY II. Resolved Scaling Relations in Void Galaxies","authors":["S. B. De Daniloff","D. Espada","S. Duarte Puertas","Y. K. González-Koda","G. Torres-Ríos","S. F. Sánchez","R. García-Benito","S. Verley","I. Pérez","M. Argudo-Fernández","A. Bongiovanni","M. Sánchez-Portal","U. Lisenfeld","M. I. Rodríguez","A. Conrado","A. Jiménez","B. Bidaran","L. Sánchez-Menguiano","T. Ruiz-Lara","A. Zurita","P. Vásquez-Bustos","M. Alcázar-Laynez","P. Villalba-González","E. Florido","R. E. Miura"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文利用ALMA CO-CAVITY和CAVITY巡天的数据，研究了41个宇宙空洞星系（VGs）在分辨尺度上的三类标度关系：Schmidt-Kennicutt关系（rSK）、分子气体主序（rMGMS）和恒星形成主序（rSFMS）。研究发现，rMGMS是三者中最紧密的关系（σ=0.16 dex），且受星系间变化影响最小。作者认为rMGMS的偏差反映了引力势的长期变化，而rSK和rSFMS的偏差则由恒星形成速率的短期波动驱动，这一特性在孤立空洞星系中尤为显著。","date":"2026-07-24","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21464","score":72,"stars":4,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2607.19471","canonical_id":"2607.19471","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The first dusty galaxies across $6 \\lesssim z \\lesssim 14$: Blue monsters, red monsters, and the bimodality of dust content in early galaxies","authors":["Sergio Martínez-González","Casiana Muñoz-Tuñón","Santiago Jiménez"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"该研究通过超新星尘埃在星团主导的恒星形成系统中的保留机制，解释了JWST和ALMA在z>10观测到的极端蓝色(β_UV≲-2.4)和红色(β_UV≳-1)星系的双峰现象，并将其与z≃6-7的尘埃大质量星系联系起来。","date":"2026-07-23","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.19471","score":72,"stars":4,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Dust a